plus **26.1 and 26.2 categorical templates by ScrambledMC**.\r\n<img width=\"2075\" height=\"1060\" alt=\"2 6 2 categorical 1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a3bcdda-ca70-455d-8ad1-fea9aea944a2\" />\r\n\r\n  - Fixes: main game files take priority over the 5-minute Hermes re-read so advancements revoke properly; \"Row 3\" checkbox persists across template switches; note window no longer reverts on ESC.\r\n  - Added DoyPingu's greyed out incomplete background texture (as seen in the screenshot).\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}